      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.289,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "Instructor: So, we added our routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 5.88,
          "en": "for the edit component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 9.51,
          "en": "Now, let's go to that component and retrieve the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.51,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "and therefore determine whether we are in edit mode or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "I will inject the activated route in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "as you learned it before, from at angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "And then NG On Init,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "this is a good place to now retrieve the ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "As before, I want to do this dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 31.89,
          "en": "So I will use my route and the params observable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "and subscribe to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "And here I will receive my params, which are of type params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "And here I then want to retrieve the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 43.41,
          "en": "on which I am currently working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.41,
          "end": 47.1,
          "en": "I will store the ID here in a property named",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.1,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "or of not named,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51.63,
          "en": "named ID, but of type number, so.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.63,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "So here I this ID equal to plus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 58.38,
          "en": "to convert it into a number, params ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.38,
          "end": 60.99,
          "en": "because that's the name of our dynamic parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.99,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "in our route set up, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.54,
          "end": 67.08,
          "en": "With that, we retrieve that ID here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 70.17,
          "en": "but I also want to find out whether I'm editing the recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.17,
          "end": 71.85,
          "en": "or creating a new one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.85,
          "end": 75.51,
          "en": "I actually want to store this information in a new property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.51,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "edit mode maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "I'll set it to false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "So, initially could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "we assumed that we are creating a new recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.26,
          "end": 84.81,
          "en": "we are not in edit mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.81,
          "end": 89.19,
          "en": "Now, I will check this whenever the parameters change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "Then I will assign a new value to edit mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "And here I will simply assign the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 96.39,
          "en": "of the following check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.39,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "I want to see if params has an ID property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "So, if it has one, then this will actually be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "a string with the ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "Otherwise it will be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "So, by comparing it to null and checking if it is not null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "I'm checking: Does it have the ID?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "Because params, and that there the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "will only be not undefined if we are in edit mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.83,
          "en": "because then an ID will be present.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 127.11,
          "en": "If this check returns true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "so if the ID indeed is undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 132.33,
          "en": "and therefore equal to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.33,
          "end": 135.54,
          "en": "this will return false because I'm checking the opposite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.54,
          "end": 138.45,
          "en": "and therefore, we are in new mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.45,
          "end": 140.34,
          "en": "And we can check this by simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 142.14,
          "en": "logging it in the console here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 143.13,
          "en": "Edit mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.13,
          "end": 144.66,
          "en": "Let's see if this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.66,
          "end": 148.68,
          "en": "We're at 0 edit here, and it returns true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "And now we're at new, and it returns false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 153.57,
          "en": "So, that seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.57,
          "end": 158.04,
          "en": "This is a nice way of checking in which mode we are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 160.23,
          "en": "So with that, we are able to retrieve the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.23,
          "end": 161.91,
          "en": "of the element we want to edit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.91,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "and to find out whether we are in edit mode or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 168,
          "en": "Now I want to make this edit link here work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168,
          "end": 169.26,
          "en": "and the new recipe link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "because these are both things that are not working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 172.973,
          "en": "as of now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.973,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "Let's work on this next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 177.45,
          "en": "And actually, this is a nice challenge for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.45,
          "end": 179.97,
          "en": "Make these links work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.97,
          "end": 184.11,
          "en": "Make sure that when we click this link or this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.11,
          "end": 187.02,
          "en": "we get taken to the recipes new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.02,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "or the recipes edit page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.58,
          "en": "for that respective recipe we had loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
